BAIT: player_reacts_to_fake_tell -> force S2
PUNISH: player_3punch_string -> S3 counter_exit
PUNISH: player_sprint_approach -> S2 widened_angle
PHASE 2 @ clock>30: retire S1; true_pattern_only
DESPERATION @ composure<25: hissatsu "Pont Couvert"
